# The witness co-signature verifier that lets a record earn EXTERNAL witness
# scope, and the test tools that check it. Compile with:
#   uv pip compile --no-header --python-version 3.12 requirements-witness.in -o requirements-witness.txt
# CI recompiles onto a copy of this file (scripts/check-lock-current.sh), so a new
# upstream release of a transitive dependency does not redden it; refresh the pins
# with --upgrade when you mean to.
# It stays a separate environment from the agent-evidence-verify extras. The observer
# and jcs-admit now come from PyPI as published releases.
# agent-evidence-verify itself is installed with --no-deps, so its own dependencies
# are listed here.
